# API adapter conventions
These instructions add to the root and order-service package hints when Goose accesses this directory.

- Treat this package as an adapter around the domain service; do not duplicate pricing rules here.
- Input and output are JSON-compatible Python dictionaries.
- Validate required fields and return stable error dictionaries instead of exposing tracebacks.
- Keep response keys backward compatible unless the user explicitly requests a contract change.
- Add contract-focused tests before changing response shapes or error handling.
